      "peak_abs": 0.582
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_00",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Although the tests passed locally, the build failed in CI, which nobody noticed until Monday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b-s7/complex_00.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 3.5248,
      "audio_seconds": 6.0,
      "rtf": 0.5875,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.7852
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_01",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The report, which had been delayed twice already, finally arrived without the appendix.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b-s7/complex_01.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 2.9848,
      "audio_seconds": 5.12,
      "rtf": 0.583,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.9727
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_02",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "If the connection drops mid-upload, the client retries; otherwise, it reports success immediately.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b-s7/complex_02.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 4.0185,
      "audio_seconds": 7.04,
      "rtf": 0.5708,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.8594
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_03",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "What surprised us was not that it failed, but how long it took anyone to notice.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b-s7/complex_03.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 2.9294,
      "audio_seconds": 5.12,
      "rtf": 0.5722,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.5625
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_04",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "He said, quite reasonably, that the deadline had never been agreed in writing.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b-s7/complex_04.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 2.5621,
      "audio_seconds": 4.48,
      "rtf": 0.5719,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.6211
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_05",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The system works — assuming, of course, that the cache has been warmed first.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b-s7/complex_05.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 2.9814,
      "audio_seconds": 5.2,
      "rtf": 0.5733,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.832
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_06",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Before deploying, verify the image was rebuilt; a stale image looks identical from outside.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b-s7/complex_06.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 3.7481,
      "audio_seconds": 6.56,
      "rtf": 0.5714,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.8945
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_07",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "She wanted to know why, given everything that had happened, we were still shipping on Friday.",
